WEBVTT

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:04.170
Mom! Dad!

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:10.240
No doubt about it. This's where the main computer is.

00:02:14.210 --> 00:02:14.930
Then...

00:02:15.340 --> 00:02:16.260
In here...

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:18.000
Alright, let's go in!

00:02:18.340 --> 00:02:19.650
But how?

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:20.400
Look.

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:22.100
There's writing.

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:24.490
I can read it.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:27.350
It says, "Hold up your hand."

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:28.940
Luna.

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:07.970
Finally, we meet the main computer Survive!

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:11.060
It's a match to see who can survive!

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:14.630
Maybe my mom and dad...

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:17.930
...are in here too!

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:18.710
Yes.

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:20.810
I'll take the lead.

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:22.390
Everyone, keep your guard up.

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:46.010
It's pretty spacious inside.

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:48.890
I wonder where Survive is.

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:53.850
It'd be nice if we could get a map like we did before.

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:00.190
Them again!

00:04:02.290 --> 00:04:02.890
This way!

00:04:12.490 --> 00:04:13.310
Go on ahead!

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:34.900
D'oh! It's a dead end!

00:04:35.140 --> 00:04:36.230
You're wrong, there's a door!

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.020
Here it comes again!

00:04:39.900 --> 00:04:40.800
O-open!

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:46.990
It opened, it opened, it opened!

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:52.880
This seems like trouble.

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:54.530
If we don't do somethin'...

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:56.060
There!

00:04:57.790 --> 00:05:00.560
Work, work, work!

00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:08.590
In the nick 'a time.

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:11.060
Why did you push 'down'?

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:13.460
I couldn't reach anythin' but down!

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:14.740
I had no choice!

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:26.990
Persistent, ain't they?

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:27.790
Run!

